-bold text-zinc-200\">Visual</div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.08] bg-[#0a0f17] px-4 py-4\"><div class=\"text-[12px] font-black tracking-[0.16em] text-cyan-300\">05</div><div class=\"mt-2 text-sm font-bold text-zinc-200\">Generate</div></div></div><div class=\"mt-8 grid gap-7 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1.25fr)]\"><section class=\"rounded-[26px] border border-white/[0.08] bg-[#0a0f17] p-5 sm:p-7\"><div class=\"text-[10px] font-black tracking-[0.24em] text-cyan-300\">STORY DIRECTOR</div><h2 class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-black\">Buat Short Story</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-500\">Kamu cukup menentukan arah cerita. Detail struktur dikerjakan otomatis oleh Driacom.</p><label class=\"mt-7 block\"><span class=\"mb-2 block text-sm font-bold text-zinc-200\">01   Ide Cerita</span><textarea rows=\"7\" placeholder=\"Contoh: seorang anak belajar bahwa menghargai orang tua lebih penting daripada harta...\" class=\"w-full resize-y rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.09] bg-[#070b12] px-4 py-4 text-sm leading-6 text-white outline-none transition placeholder:text-zinc-600 focus:border-cyan-400/30\"></textarea><span class=\"mt-2 block text-right text-[11px] text-zinc-600\">0 / 1000</span></label><div class=\"mt-5 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\"><label><span class=\"mb-2 block text-sm font-bold text-zinc-200\">02   Durasi</span><select class=\"w-full rounded-xl border border-white/[0.09] bg-[#070b12] px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-200 outline-none focus:border-cyan-400/30\"><option>30 detik</option><option>60 detik</option><option>90 detik</option><option>120 detik</option></select></label><label><span class=\"mb-2 block text-sm font-bold text-zinc-200\">03   Gaya Cerita</span><select class=\"w-full rounded-xl border border-white/[0.09] bg-[#070b12] px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-200 outline-none focus:border-cyan-400/30\"><option>Natural &amp; Emosional</option><option>Inspiratif</option><option>Lucu</option><option>Menyentuh</option><option>Twist Ending</option></select></label></div><label class=\"mt-5 block\"><span class=\"mb-2 block text-sm font-bold text-zinc-200\">04   Narasi</span><select class=\"w-full rounded-xl border border-white/[0.09] bg-[#070b12] px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-200 outline-none focus:border-cyan-400/30\"><option>Narator + Dialog</option><option>Narator Dominan</option><option>Dialog Dominan</option><option>Tanpa Narator</option></select></label><button type=\"button\" disabled=\"\" class=\"mt-6 w-full cursor-not-allowed rounded-xl border border-cyan-400/20 bg-cyan-400/[0.06] px-5 py-4 text-sm font-black tracking-[0.08em] text-cyan-200\">RACIK SHORT STORY — MESIN SEGERA DIAKTIFKAN</button></section><section class=\"min-h-[620px] rounded-[26px] border border-white/[0.08] bg-[#080d15] p-5 sm:p-7\"><div class=\"flex h-full min-h-[560px] flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-white/[0.08] bg-[#070b12] text-center\"><div class=\"flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-cyan-400/20 bg-cyan-400/[0.035] text-2xl text-cyan-300\">✦</div><h2 class=\"mt-5 text-2xl font-black\">Story Workspace</h2><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-md px-5 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-600\">Isi ide cerita dan pilihan dasar. Driacom akan membuat struktur cerita, karakter, scene, dialog, dan arahan produksi di area ini.</p></div></section></div><footer class=\"mt-10 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-7 text-center text-[11px] tracking-[0.16em] text-zinc-700\">DRIACOM — PROMPT AI GENERATOR</footer></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"mt-auto border-t border-white/10 bg-[#05070d] px-6 py-5 text-center\" style=\"background-color:#05070d\"><p class=\"text-xs text-white/45\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <a href=\"https://www.driacom.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"font-medium text-white/65 underline decoration-white/20 underline-offset-2 transition hover:text-white\">Driacom</a> <!-- -->- Prompt AI Generator</p></footer><script sr